OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteers complete restoration of
OL,4,AD-Day aircraft
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the volunteers, Jonathan
OL,7,FRoberts, 65, said the project had
OL,8,Fhelped him "incredibly" after he
OL,9,Fsuffered a stroke 10 years ago.
